  obtain ⟨Θ, hΘ1, hΘ2⟩ := GlobalTheory.T.sectionValue_genericTangent_eq_unit_mul_combination V (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal V) D A G U.toUnifPre C w₀ ρ hρ y yA hy hvec k i₀
